zone:25:25:0:0:0:3:If you just come here, read this
dialog:25:25:0:0:0:0:Hello %name%. My name is Nelson, and wellcome to the grand mansion=I don't live alone here though. The one who's sitting on the sofa directly to your right is Crystal, my sister, go talk to her, assuming she don't fill you in with her rumbling and chats=and there're a few more people live here as well. they spend most of their time inside their room, so you may want to visit them. Don't worry, they're friendly around new people=well, go and explore the whole mansion. I can assure you, there're plenty of things to be discovered and you may hear some stories during your exploration=not that I say this mansion is some kind of adventure map though, but that's just how I rephrase it. Now, off you go!
