src:28:28:1:1:1:3:-17:100:tv2.ogg
dialog:28:28:1:1:1:1:Yo %name%. I'm Crystal, if Nelson hasn't mentioned my name yet. I'm the most charming and gorgeous person in this mansion haha=sorry, just joking. I only say something that my mom always throws at me, in this case, compliment. Anyway, I'm 20 years old, specifically two years older than Nelson=I love music and audio related stuffs. And just like Nelson, I'm a vocalist myself. We used to join various singing competitions during school time, and we make a pretty good team=Unlike Nelson, I'm not really good at speaking English, I mean, Nelson isn't literally good either, but he can replicate accents pretty well, while I cannot do that sometimes=I do better in Indonesian compare to Nelson though. I don't have problem with grammars and speaking comfidently in Indonesian, while Nelson sometimes struggle with vocabularies=Now, I'm sure that you've got plenty to explore, and I don't want to take your time too much reading this, so, farewell, and hope to see you in my room later
